1. She has large wings that require significant space. (Verbatim: "These wings... these wings need space. They need lots of space because they're quite big.")
2. She is currently working toward Twitch Affiliate status, needing one more day to reach the 7-day requirement. (Verbatim: "I'm on day six, day six out of seven. I think you need seven to hit affiliate.")
3. She struggled financially during her university's Freshers Week due to her student loan not arriving until the following week. (Verbatim: "My student loan didn't actually come in until the week after so I didn't actually have any money that week like none I had zero monies.")
4. She attended university in England, where Freshers Week is a traditional first-week event involving social and party activities. (Verbatim: "In England um at British like universities it's like tradition to have this thing called freshers week.")
5. She participated in one night of Freshers Week social events despite having no money. (Verbatim: "I did go out for one of the nights and I remember it was like with my whole halls...")
6. She finds it difficult to stay awake during early morning hours, often experiencing mental "spaced outness." (Verbatim: "I'd be just having these moments of spaced outness in the morning.")
7. She enjoys drinking cola in the morning, despite knowing it's not ideal. (Verbatim: "I really really really want it um no that water was warm... oh hey i got the mini can of cola")
8. She has a habit of drinking mini cans of cola, which she refers to as "mini cans." (Verbatim: "I'm still drinking these mini cans but i'm out there okay")
9. She has a dog that is active in her home environment, sometimes causing noise like drilling. (Verbatim: "If you hear any drilling it's not me it's the great outdoors because i closed my bedroom door but it opened up the window in the other room for my dog")
10. She humorously refers to herself as not being cute, despite being the subject of others calling her "the cutest." (Verbatim: "I am not the cutest i'm very far from cute i am here to become and try to be cute") [end of text]



1. She has a strong reaction to specific fashion advice mentioning My Little Pony and Walmart’s junior section. (Verbatim: "why is it got such specific instructions to it... why is this wiki house so specific")  
