1. She experienced financial hardship during her first week of university due to delayed student loan disbursement. (Verbatim: "that week like none I had zero monies I had no monies at all because I was like my student loan and I was like oh you don't get student loan until that week but freshers week is the week before so I don't have any money")
2. She stayed in her dorm room during her first week of university, choosing to stay in pajamas and play League of Legends instead of going out. (Verbatim: "I went back to my room I instantly it was like pajamas whacked you open my laptop turned on League of Legends and I was like yeah")
